│   13     """Compute a CRC-32 checksum compatible with zlib.crc32's return contract.                                                                         │
│   14                                                                                                                                                        │
│   15     zlib.crc32(payload) returns a CRC-32/ISO-HDLC checksum as an unsigned                                                                              │
│   16     32-bit integer, computed with an implicit initial seed of 0.                                                                                       │
│   17                                                                                                                                                        │
│   18     fastcrc.crc32.iso_hdlc(payload) computes the same CRC-32/ISO-HDLC                                                                                  │
