│   20     initial seed of 0, but returns a plain Python int without guaranteeing                                                                             │
│   21     it is masked to 32 bits.                                                                                                                           │
│   22                                                                                                                                                        │
│   23     This wrapper calls fastcrc.crc32.iso_hdlc and masks the result with                                                                                │
