│   15     """Create a default HTTP client, bridging requests.Session() -> httpx.Client().                                                                    │
│   16                                                                                                                                                        │
│   17     `requests.Session()` has no default timeout: requests calls will block                                                                             │
│   18     indefinitely unless a timeout is explicitly passed on each request.                                                                                │
│   19     `httpx.Client()`, in contrast, defaults to a 5 second timeout on all                                                                               │
│   20     requests unless overridden. To preserve the original "no implicit                                                                                  │
│   21     timeout" behavior of requests, this wrapper explicitly constructs the                                                                              │
│   22     client with `timeout=None`.                                                                                                                        │
│   23                                                                                                                                                        │
│   24     Callers should also note that `resp.raise_for_status()` on the object                                                                              │
│   25     returned here will raise `httpx.HTTPStatusError` instead of                                                                                        │
│   26     `requests.exceptions.HTTPError` -- callers catching the old exception                                                                              │
│   27     type need to be updated accordingly. Additionally, unlike                                                                                          │
│   28     `requests.Session`, `httpx.Client` holds pooled connections that should                                                                            │
│   29     be released deterministically; prefer using the returned client as a                                                                               │
│   30     context manager (`with ... as client:`) or calling `.close()` on it                                                                                │
│   31     explicitly when done, rather than relying on garbage collection.                                                                                   │
