    ├── Constraints: requires_connector
    └── All four packages provide client-side Modbus communication (TCP and/or RTU) for reading/writing holding registers, matching the file's use of 
        ModbusTcpClient to poll temperature/pressure and write valve position. The code already isolates the client behind a dependency-injected ModbusIO class
        and even documents pymodbus->minimalmodbus as an intended substitution target, indicating the codebase anticipates swapping Modbus backends.

