get_demand/get_runtimes/command methods — this is a breaking architectural change that cannot be hidden behind a wrapper.
    - No wrapper can reconcile a fully synchronous public API contract with aiohttp's mandatory async execution model without either blocking the event loop 
improperly (defeating aiohttp's purpose) or forcing a cascading async rewrite of the whole call chain.

